# The coco-sync image is built with the repository root as its context (its
# Dockerfile copies `coco-sync/...`). Without this file the context would include
# src-tauri/target, which is tens of gigabytes. Exclude everything, then re-admit
# only the files the Dockerfile actually copies.
**

!coco-sync/package.json
!coco-sync/tsconfig.json
!coco-sync/tsconfig.build.json
!coco-sync/src/**
